Monocypher 4.0.2, vendored
==========================

Upstream: https://monocypher.org/ (Loup Vaillant et al.), dual-licensed
BSD-2-Clause OR CC0-1.0 (see the header of each file). Kome binds it from
spark/src/kome-crypto.adb; nothing here is modified except as noted below.

